noopener noreferrer","children":"《Rust Atomics and Locks》"}],"，该书对锁这一概念和底层原理进行了非常详尽的探讨，并且给出了 Rust 中 SpinLock、Mutex、RWMutex、Channel 和 Arc 等基础并发工具的手写实战案例，对于想更加深入理解并发编程尤其那些想手写并发工具的读者，非常推荐阅读该书。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"特此声明，本篇是笔者基于 Go 1.25.3 版本源码、并与 Google Gemini 3Pro 共创所作，非常庆幸在当今 AI 时代下获取知识已是如此便利，且也为学习者从第一性原理理解所学知识大大降低了门槛。不过本篇的篇章安排和叙述逻辑，均由笔者把控和审阅，欢迎放心阅读。"}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"结论先行","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#结论先行","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#结论先行"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"结论先行","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":4,"offset":370},"end":{"line":5,"column":8,"offset":374}}}]},"children":"结论先行"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["本篇我们将探讨 Go 语言中的各种\"锁\"的底层实现原理，包括 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Mutex"}],"、",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"RWMutex"}],"、",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"WaitGroup"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Once"}]," 。它们都离不开两个核心基础：",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"atomic"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"sema"}],"："]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"atomic"}]," 即原子变量，是一种硬件层面加锁的机制，可以保证基本类型在高并发下的并发安全性，实现原子操作。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"sema"}]," 全称 semaphore，也叫信号锁 / 信号量锁，它的核心是一个 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"uint32"}]," 类型的值，含义是同时可并发的协程数量。在 Go 语言里面，每个 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"seam"}]," 背后都对应一个 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"semaRoot "}],"结构体。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"我们先给出上述几种并发工具的简要概述，后文再进行详细阐述："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Mutex"}],"：互斥锁，只能有一个持有者。\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":"正常模式：得到锁返回，得不到锁自旋，自旋多了就饥饿。"}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":"饥饿模式：不自选，直接入队等待。依次从队里唤醒协程并授予锁。"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"RWMutex"}],"：读写锁，只能一个写，可以同时多个读。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"WaitGroup"}],"：一组协程等待另外一组协程全部执行完毕再执行。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Once"}],"：控制一段代码在并发中只执行一次。"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"Cond"}],"：条件变量，允许多个 Goroutine 等待某个条件成立后被唤醒，常用于处理生产者-消费者模型。"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n